Attack up to three adjacent targets for [122%, 131%, 138%, 144%, 150% (TL1-5; PARADOX 300)] weapon damage.  If any attack hits you'll create a temporal shear dealing [121, 163, 195, 223, 247 (TL1-5; SP 100; PARADOX 300)] temporal damage in a radius [4, 5, 5, 6, 6 (TL1-5; PARADOX 300)] cone.

Each target you hit with your weapons beyond the first increases the damage of the shear by 25%.  Targets reduced below 20% of maximum life by the shear may be instantly slain.

The cone damage improves with your Spellpower.
